parties outside these grants requires separate permission. Ordinary professional services remain
permitted even when the Suite is a principal aid. Nothing here narrows CC BY-NC 4.0 or statutory
rights. Third-party rights remain separate. Part B is subject to its own termination, reinstatement
and limitation-of-liability provisions and does not modify Part C.

